#~ "raster data processing and access to appropriate computing power, e.g., a "
#~ "cloud service, is required to store and process the data, especially for "
#~ "large countries. The UNCCD is developing a procedure for the bulk pre-"
#~ "processing of raster data, which will eventually make sex-disaggregated data"
